# Cursor AI Rules
# Refer to AGENTS.md for binding architecture, constraints, and workflow roles.

- Always follow the guidelines and constraints defined in `AGENTS.md`.
- Validate all tasks against `Plans/` and run `python3 Plans/check_pipeline.py`.
- For 3D meshes, enforce 0 boundary edges and 0 non-manifold edges using `python3 .agents/skills/mesh-auditor/scripts/audit_stl.py`.
- Ensure continuous documentation review with every commit and synchronize with `git push origin main`.
